er-radius); }

.stat-number { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-pri=
mary); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

.stat-label { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); text-transform=
: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

